<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Supplementary</h2>

</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Technical Details</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section provides the technical details necessary to reproduce our framework. See Table <a href="#A1.T1" title="Table S1 ‣ Appendix A Technical Details ‣ EHR-MCP: Real-world Evaluation of Clinical Information Retrieval by Large Language Models via Model Context Protocol" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">S1</span></a> for the versions of the major libraries used.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F1" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.15957v1/figures/system_architecture.png" id="A1.F1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:381/150;" width="381" height="150" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure S1</span>: </span><span id="A1.F1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Architecture of the EHR-MCP framework</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.T1" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A1.T1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table S1</span>: </span><span id="A1.T1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Software environment and library versions.</span></figcaption>
