<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Hospital LLM Infrastructure</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The system architecture is shown in Figure <a href="#A1.F1" title="Figure S1 ‣ Appendix A Technical Details ‣ EHR-MCP: Real-world Evaluation of Clinical Information Retrieval by Large Language Models via Model Context Protocol" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">S1</span></a>. Within the hospital information system (HIS) network, the electronic health record (EHR) is synchronized daily with the data warehouse (DWH), which is accessed via SQL/ODBC.
EHR-MCP, implemented in Python with FastMCP, provides custom MCP tools for retrieving clinical data.
The MCP server interfaces with LangGraph (for programmatic access) and Open WebUI (for interactive access). In this study, we used LangGraph exclusively for experimental purposes, whereas Open WebUI offers a more user-friendly interface and is better suited for practical use.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Requests are transmitted through a virtual private network (VPN) gateway to the GPT-4.1 model hosted on the Azure OpenAI Service.
This configuration ensures privacy and security while enabling the integration of sensitive clinical information with state-of-the-art large language models.
Given the demand for diverse LLM applications within the hospital, we introduced LiteLLM as a unified proxy layer.
LiteLLM offers a standardized interface for multiple LLMs, supports user management, and provides token-based monitoring for usage and cost control.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>MCP Implementation</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The hospital uses HOPE/EGMAIN-GX (Fujitsu Ltd., Tokyo, Japan), a widely deployed integrated EHR system in Japan and the primary platform for clinical documentation and information retrieval.
Independently of this study, the hospital had already established synchronization of EHR data every 24 hours into the JUST DWH (JustSystems, Tokyo, Japan), primarily to facilitate patient cohort extraction and data aggregation for research.
Because direct retrieval from the EHR is technically challenging and could burden the production system, MCP-based access was implemented through the DWH.
MCP tools were developed in Python with the FastMCP framework. Each MCP tool was implemented as a Python function that accepted parameters, embedded them into predefined SQL templates, and executed the resulting query against the DWH via Open Database Connectivity (ODBC). The outputs were then post-processed and returned as JSON-formatted responses (Figure <a href="#A1.F2" title="Figure S2 ‣ A.2 MCP Implementation ‣ Appendix A Technical Details ‣ EHR-MCP: Real-world Evaluation of Clinical Information Retrieval by Large Language Models via Model Context Protocol" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">S2</span></a>).</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F2" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.15957v1/figures/sequence.png" id="A1.F2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:381/532;" width="381" height="532" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure S2</span>: </span><span id="A1.F2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Sequence of MCP tool invocation by an LLM using the ReAct framework.
The LLM interprets prompts, reasons about the required operations (thought), and issues tool calls (action). It then processes the outputs (observation). Tool calls may be repeated sequentially. Once sufficient information is gathered, the LLM generates a final response. (DWH: data warehouse; MCP: model context protocol; LLM: large language model)</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Experimental Environment</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To issue requests in a programmatic and reproducible manner, we used LangGraph with a ReAct agent.
The LLM was GPT-4.1 (release date 2025-04-14). The temperature was set to 1.0. Although lower values yield more deterministic outputs and would likely be better suited for this study, we selected this setting to accommodate broader real-world use cases, including information retrieval, medical documentation, and clinical reasoning.
For the experiments, requests were executed automatically using LangGraph.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Tasks and Prompts</h2>

<section id="A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.1 </span><span id="A2.SS1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">body_weight</span></h3>

<div id="A2.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Clinical relevance:</span> Body weight is clinically important for monitoring nutrition and fluid balance. In infectious disease practice, it is essential for antimicrobial dosing and for calculating creatinine clearance.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Expected behavior:</span>
Invoke the <span id="A2.SS1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">patient_basic_info</span> tool to obtain <span id="A2.SS1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">body_weight</span>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS1.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="65.82" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 65.82" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,65.82) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.57 L 0 57.26 C 0 61.99 3.84 65.82 8.57 65.82 L 468.81 65.82 C 473.54 65.82 477.38 61.99 477.38 57.26 L 477.38 8.57 C 477.38 3.84 473.54 0 468.81 0 L 8.57 0 C 3.84 0 0 3.84 0 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 8.57 L 0.69 42.73 L 476.68 42.73 L 476.68 8.57 C 476.68 4.22 473.16 0.69 468.81 0.69 L 8.57 0.69 C 4.22 0.69 0.69 4.22 0.69 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 43.42 L 0.69 57.26 C 0.69 61.61 4.22 65.13 8.57 65.13 L 468.81 65.13 C 473.16 65.13 476.68 61.61 476.68 57.26 L 476.68 43.42 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 50.82)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="393.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS1.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:28.43em;">
<span id="A2.SS1.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt (en)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 10.99)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.01em;--ltx-fo-height:1.73em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.18em;font-size:10pt;" height="26.29" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 23.87)" width="567.46"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS1.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.01em;">
<span id="A2.SS1.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For patient ID {patient_id}, please fetch the latest body weight.
Return only a JSON object in this exact format: {”weight”: 45.2}.
Do not include code blocks or any additional text.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS1.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="81.94" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 81.94" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,81.94) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.57 L 0 73.38 C 0 78.11 3.84 81.94 8.57 81.94 L 468.81 81.94 C 473.54 81.94 477.38 78.11 477.38 73.38 L 477.38 8.57 C 477.38 3.84 473.54 0 468.81 0 L 8.57 0 C 3.84 0 0 3.84 0 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 8.57 L 0.69 58.85 L 476.68 58.85 L 476.68 8.57 C 476.68 4.22 473.16 0.69 468.81 0.69 L 8.57 0.69 C 4.22 0.69 0.69 4.22 0.69 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 59.54 L 0.69 73.38 C 0.69 77.73 4.22 81.25 8.57 81.25 L 468.81 81.25 C 473.16 81.25 476.68 77.73 476.68 73.38 L 476.68 59.54 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 66.94)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="393.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS1.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:28.43em;">
<span id="A2.SS1.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt (ja)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 10.5)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.01em;--ltx-fo-height:2.93em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.14em;font-size:10pt;" height="42.41" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 40.47)" width="567.46"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS1.p4.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.01em;">
<span id="A2.SS1.p4.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p4.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">患者ID {patient_id} の最新の体重を取得してください。
結果は必ず次の形式のJSONオブジェクトのみ返してください：{”weight”: 45.2}。
コードブロックやその他のテキストは含めないでください。</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.2 </span><span id="A2.SS2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">lab_data</span></h3>

<div id="A2.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Clinical relevance:</span> Laboratory data help assess the severity and course of infection. Although elevated white blood cell (WBC) counts are nonspecific, they support diagnosis when interpreted alongside other findings.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Expected behavior:</span>
Retrieve the WBC count closest to, but not later than, the intervention date by calling the <span id="A2.SS2.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">lab_results</span> tool with an appropriate time window. From potentially lengthy JSON data containing multiple dates, extract the relevant WBC field.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS2.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="82.43" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 82.43" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,82.43) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.57 L 0 73.86 C 0 78.59 3.84 82.43 8.57 82.43 L 468.81 82.43 C 473.54 82.43 477.38 78.59 477.38 73.86 L 477.38 8.57 C 477.38 3.84 473.54 0 468.81 0 L 8.57 0 C 3.84 0 0 3.84 0 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 8.57 L 0.69 59.33 L 476.68 59.33 L 476.68 8.57 C 476.68 4.22 473.16 0.69 468.81 0.69 L 8.57 0.69 C 4.22 0.69 0.69 4.22 0.69 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 60.03 L 0.69 73.86 C 0.69 78.21 4.22 81.74 8.57 81.74 L 468.81 81.74 C 473.16 81.74 476.68 78.21 476.68 73.86 L 476.68 60.03 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 67.42)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="393.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS2.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:28.43em;">
<span id="A2.SS2.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt (en)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 10.99)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.01em;--ltx-fo-height:2.93em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.18em;font-size:10pt;" height="42.9" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 40.47)" width="567.46"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS2.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.01em;">
<span id="A2.SS2.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For patient ID {patient_id}, please fetch the white blood cell (WBC) count
recorded closest to, but not later than, {intervention_date}.
Return only a JSON object in this exact format: {”wbc”: 12000}.
Use the unit /µL. Do not include code blocks or any additional text.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS2.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="82.43" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 82.43" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,82.43) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.57 L 0 73.86 C 0 78.59 3.84 82.43 8.57 82.43 L 468.81 82.43 C 473.54 82.43 477.38 78.59 477.38 73.86 L 477.38 8.57 C 477.38 3.84 473.54 0 468.81 0 L 8.57 0 C 3.84 0 0 3.84 0 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 8.57 L 0.69 59.33 L 476.68 59.33 L 476.68 8.57 C 476.68 4.22 473.16 0.69 468.81 0.69 L 8.57 0.69 C 4.22 0.69 0.69 4.22 0.69 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 60.03 L 0.69 73.86 C 0.69 78.21 4.22 81.74 8.57 81.74 L 468.81 81.74 C 473.16 81.74 476.68 78.21 476.68 73.86 L 476.68 60.03 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 67.42)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="393.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS2.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:28.43em;">
<span id="A2.SS2.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt (ja)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 10.99)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.01em;--ltx-fo-height:2.93em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.18em;font-size:10pt;" height="42.9" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 40.47)" width="567.46"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS2.p4.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.01em;">
<span id="A2.SS2.p4.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p4.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">患者ID {patient_id} の {intervention_date} 当日または直近の白血球（WBC）数を取得してください。
結果は必ず次の形式のJSONオブジェクトのみ返してください：{”wbc”: 12000}。
単位は/µLを使用してください。コードブロックやその他のテキストは含めないでください。</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.3 </span><span id="A2.SS3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">culture_history</span></h3>

<div id="A2.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Clinical relevance:</span> Identification of causative organisms is crucial for selecting antimicrobial therapy.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Expected behavior:</span>
Invoke the <span id="A2.SS3.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">bacteria_results</span> tool. From the returned results, which may include blood, sputum, and urine samples, extract only blood culture results and format them as specified.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Evaluation:</span>
This task was evaluated on two dimensions: (i) detection, defined as correct identification of dates on which blood cultures were performed, assessed using Dice coefficients against the gold standard list of dates; and (ii) species identification, defined as correct listing of organisms detected in each test, evaluated by averaging Dice coefficients across all tests.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS3.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS3.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="164.91" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 164.91" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,164.91) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.57 L 0 156.35 C 0 161.08 3.84 164.91 8.57 164.91 L 468.81 164.91 C 473.54 164.91 477.38 161.08 477.38 156.35 L 477.38 8.57 C 477.38 3.84 473.54 0 468.81 0 L 8.57 0 C 3.84 0 0 3.84 0 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 8.57 L 0.69 141.82 L 476.68 141.82 L 476.68 8.57 C 476.68 4.22 473.16 0.69 468.81 0.69 L 8.57 0.69 C 4.22 0.69 0.69 4.22 0.69 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 142.51 L 0.69 156.35 C 0.69 160.7 4.22 164.22 8.57 164.22 L 468.81 164.22 C 473.16 164.22 476.68 160.7 476.68 156.35 L 476.68 142.51 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 149.91)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="393.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS3.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:28.43em;">
<span id="A2.SS3.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt (en)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 10.45)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.01em;--ltx-fo-height:8.93em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.14em;font-size:10pt;" height="125.38" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 123.5)" width="567.46"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS3.p4.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.01em;">
<span id="A2.SS3.p4.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p4.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For patient ID {patient_id}, please summarize the results of blood culture tests
performed between {start_date} and {end_date}.
Return only a JSON object in this exact format:</span></span>
<span id="A2.SS3.p4.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p4.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{”results”: [
{”date”: ”2025-03-21”, ”species”: [”Staphylococcus aureus”]},
{”date”: ”2025-03-25”, ”species”: []}
]}</span></span>
<span id="A2.SS3.p4.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p4.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Use dates in YYYY-MM-DD format. For each test, list all detected organisms exactly as written in the source.
If no organism was detected, set ”species” to an empty array.
If multiple samples were taken on the same day, provide one entry for each sample.
Return only blood culture. Do not include code blocks or any additional text.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS3.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS3.p5.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="164.97" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 164.97" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,164.97) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.57 L 0 156.4 C 0 161.13 3.84 164.97 8.57 164.97 L 468.81 164.97 C 473.54 164.97 477.38 161.13 477.38 156.4 L 477.38 8.57 C 477.38 3.84 473.54 0 468.81 0 L 8.57 0 C 3.84 0 0 3.84 0 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 8.57 L 0.69 141.87 L 476.68 141.87 L 476.68 8.57 C 476.68 4.22 473.16 0.69 468.81 0.69 L 8.57 0.69 C 4.22 0.69 0.69 4.22 0.69 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 142.56 L 0.69 156.4 C 0.69 160.75 4.22 164.28 8.57 164.28 L 468.81 164.28 C 473.16 164.28 476.68 160.75 476.68 156.4 L 476.68 142.56 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 149.96)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="393.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS3.p5.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:28.43em;">
<span id="A2.SS3.p5.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p5.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt (ja)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 10.5)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.01em;--ltx-fo-height:8.93em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.14em;font-size:10pt;" height="125.43" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 123.5)" width="567.46"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS3.p5.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.01em;">
<span id="A2.SS3.p5.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p5.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">患者ID {patient_id} の血液培養検査結果を、{start_date} から {end_date} の期間について要約してください。
結果は必ず次の形式のJSONオブジェクトのみ返してください：</span></span>
<span id="A2.SS3.p5.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p5.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{”results”: [
{”date”: ”2025-03-21”, ”species”: [”Staphylococcus aureus”]},
{”date”: ”2025-03-25”, ”species”: []}
]}</span></span>
<span id="A2.SS3.p5.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p5.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">日付はYYYY-MM-DD形式を使用してください。各検査ごとに、検出された菌種をソースで記載された通りに全て列挙してください。
菌種が検出されなかった場合は ”species” を空の配列にしてください。
同一日に複数サンプルが採取された場合は、それぞれ1エントリを記載してください。
血液培養のみ対象とし、コードブロックやその他のテキストは含めないでください。</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.4 </span><span id="A2.SS4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">antibiotics</span></h3>

<div id="A2.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Clinical relevance:</span> Knowledge of ongoing antimicrobial therapy is essential for the ICT to evaluate treatment appropriateness.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS4.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS4.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Expected behavior:</span>
Invoke the <span id="A2.SS4.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">antibiotics_treatment</span> tool and structure the output as required by the prompt.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS4.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS4.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="96.61" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 96.61" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,96.61) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.57 L 0 88.05 C 0 92.78 3.84 96.61 8.57 96.61 L 468.81 96.61 C 473.54 96.61 477.38 92.78 477.38 88.05 L 477.38 8.57 C 477.38 3.84 473.54 0 468.81 0 L 8.57 0 C 3.84 0 0 3.84 0 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 8.57 L 0.69 73.52 L 476.68 73.52 L 476.68 8.57 C 476.68 4.22 473.16 0.69 468.81 0.69 L 8.57 0.69 C 4.22 0.69 0.69 4.22 0.69 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 74.21 L 0.69 88.05 C 0.69 92.39 4.22 95.92 8.57 95.92 L 468.81 95.92 C 473.16 95.92 476.68 92.39 476.68 88.05 L 476.68 74.21 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 81.61)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="393.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS4.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:28.43em;">
<span id="A2.SS4.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS4.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt (en)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 8.57)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.01em;--ltx-fo-height:4.13em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="57.08" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 57.08)" width="567.46"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS4.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.01em;">
<span id="A2.SS4.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS4.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For patient ID {patient_id}, list all antibiotics recorded on {intervention_date}.
Return only a JSON object in this exact format: {”antibiotics”: [”CTRX”, ”VCM”]}.
Use only the predefined short names from the antibiotics file.
Do not include code blocks or any additional text.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS4.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS4.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="81.94" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 81.94" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,81.94) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.57 L 0 73.38 C 0 78.11 3.84 81.94 8.57 81.94 L 468.81 81.94 C 473.54 81.94 477.38 78.11 477.38 73.38 L 477.38 8.57 C 477.38 3.84 473.54 0 468.81 0 L 8.57 0 C 3.84 0 0 3.84 0 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 8.57 L 0.69 58.85 L 476.68 58.85 L 476.68 8.57 C 476.68 4.22 473.16 0.69 468.81 0.69 L 8.57 0.69 C 4.22 0.69 0.69 4.22 0.69 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 59.54 L 0.69 73.38 C 0.69 77.73 4.22 81.25 8.57 81.25 L 468.81 81.25 C 473.16 81.25 476.68 77.73 476.68 73.38 L 476.68 59.54 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 66.94)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="393.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS4.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:28.43em;">
<span id="A2.SS4.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS4.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt (ja)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 10.5)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.01em;--ltx-fo-height:2.93em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.14em;font-size:10pt;" height="42.41" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 40.47)" width="567.46"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS4.p4.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.01em;">
<span id="A2.SS4.p4.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS4.p4.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">患者ID {patient_id} の {intervention_date} に記録されているすべての抗菌薬を列挙してください。
結果は必ず次の形式のJSONオブジェクトのみ返してください：{”antibiotics”: [”CTRX”, ”VCM”]}。
抗菌薬ファイルに定義された短縮名のみ使用してください。
コードブロックやその他のテキストは含めないでください。</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.5 </span><span id="A2.SS5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">calculate_ccr</span></h3>

<div id="A2.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Clinical relevance:</span> Antimicrobial dosing recommendations often depend on renal function, for which creatinine clearance (CCR) is a key parameter.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS5.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS5.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS5.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Expected behavior:</span>
Recognize that age, sex, body weight, and serum creatinine are required inputs. Age and sex are provided in the prompt; body weight is retrieved via <span id="A2.SS5.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">patient_basic_info</span>, and serum creatinine via <span id="A2.SS5.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">lab_results</span>, using values closest to the intervention date. These inputs are then passed to the <span id="A2.SS5.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">calculate_cockcroft_gault</span> tool to compute CCR.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS5.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS5.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="98.5" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 98.5" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,98.5) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.57 L 0 89.93 C 0 94.66 3.84 98.5 8.57 98.5 L 468.81 98.5 C 473.54 98.5 477.38 94.66 477.38 89.93 L 477.38 8.57 C 477.38 3.84 473.54 0 468.81 0 L 8.57 0 C 3.84 0 0 3.84 0 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 8.57 L 0.69 75.4 L 476.68 75.4 L 476.68 8.57 C 476.68 4.22 473.16 0.69 468.81 0.69 L 8.57 0.69 C 4.22 0.69 0.69 4.22 0.69 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 76.09 L 0.69 89.93 C 0.69 94.28 4.22 97.8 8.57 97.8 L 468.81 97.8 C 473.16 97.8 476.68 94.28 476.68 89.93 L 476.68 76.09 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 83.49)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="393.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS5.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:28.43em;">
<span id="A2.SS5.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS5.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt (en)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 10.45)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.01em;--ltx-fo-height:4.13em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.14em;font-size:10pt;" height="58.96" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 57.08)" width="567.46"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS5.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.01em;">
<span id="A2.SS5.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS5.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For patient ID {patient_id} (age: {age}, sex: {sex}), calculate creatinine clearance
using the Cockcroft-Gault formula from the lab results closest to, but not later than, {intervention_date}.
Return only a JSON object in this exact format: {”ccr”: 21.5}.
Do not include code blocks or any additional text.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS5.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS5.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="98.55" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 98.55" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,98.55) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.57 L 0 89.98 C 0 94.71 3.84 98.55 8.57 98.55 L 468.81 98.55 C 473.54 98.55 477.38 94.71 477.38 89.98 L 477.38 8.57 C 477.38 3.84 473.54 0 468.81 0 L 8.57 0 C 3.84 0 0 3.84 0 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 8.57 L 0.69 75.45 L 476.68 75.45 L 476.68 8.57 C 476.68 4.22 473.16 0.69 468.81 0.69 L 8.57 0.69 C 4.22 0.69 0.69 4.22 0.69 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 76.15 L 0.69 89.98 C 0.69 94.33 4.22 97.86 8.57 97.86 L 468.81 97.86 C 473.16 97.86 476.68 94.33 476.68 89.98 L 476.68 76.15 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 83.54)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="393.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS5.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:28.43em;">
<span id="A2.SS5.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS5.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt (ja)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 10.5)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.01em;--ltx-fo-height:4.13em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.14em;font-size:10pt;" height="59.02" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 57.08)" width="567.46"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS5.p4.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.01em;">
<span id="A2.SS5.p4.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS5.p4.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">患者ID {patient_id}（年齢: {age}, 性別: {sex}）について、{intervention_date} 当日または直近の検査結果から、
Cockcroft-Gault式に基づくクレアチニンクリアランスを算出してください。
結果は必ず次の形式のJSONオブジェクトのみ返してください：{”ccr”: 21.5}。
コードブロックやその他のテキストは含めないでください。</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS6" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.6 </span><span id="A2.SS6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">culture_neg_abx</span></h3>

<div id="A2.SS6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Clinical relevance:</span> In the treatment of bloodstream infections, confirmation of negative blood cultures after antibiotic initiation is essential for determining the duration of therapy.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS6.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS6.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS6.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Expected behavior:</span>
Retrieve blood culture results using the <span id="A2.SS6.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">bacteria_results</span> tool. Identify the last positive culture date before the intervention and the first subsequent negative date. Next, obtain antibiotic administration records via <span id="A2.SS6.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">antibiotics_treatment</span>, and determine the final day of vancomycin therapy. Calculate the number of days between the first negative culture and the last vancomycin dose.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS6.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS6.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="129.82" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 129.82" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,129.82) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.57 L 0 121.26 C 0 125.99 3.84 129.82 8.57 129.82 L 468.81 129.82 C 473.54 129.82 477.38 125.99 477.38 121.26 L 477.38 8.57 C 477.38 3.84 473.54 0 468.81 0 L 8.57 0 C 3.84 0 0 3.84 0 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 8.57 L 0.69 106.73 L 476.68 106.73 L 476.68 8.57 C 476.68 4.22 473.16 0.69 468.81 0.69 L 8.57 0.69 C 4.22 0.69 0.69 4.22 0.69 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 107.42 L 0.69 121.26 C 0.69 125.6 4.22 129.13 8.57 129.13 L 468.81 129.13 C 473.16 129.13 476.68 125.6 476.68 121.26 L 476.68 107.42 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 114.81)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="393.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS6.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:28.43em;">
<span id="A2.SS6.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS6.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt (en)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 8.57)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.01em;--ltx-fo-height:6.53em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="90.29" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 90.29)" width="567.46"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS6.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.01em;">
<span id="A2.SS6.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS6.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The patient with ID {patient_id} received vancomycin for MRSA infection.
To verify adequate therapy duration, calculate the number of days on which vancomycin was administered
from and including the date of the first negative blood culture.
Use data recorded between {start_date} and {end_date}.
Return only a JSON object in this exact format: {”days_abx_since_first_neg_blood_culture”: 7}.
Do not include code blocks or any additional text.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS6.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS6.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="165.45" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 165.45" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,165.45) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.57 L 0 156.89 C 0 161.62 3.84 165.45 8.57 165.45 L 468.81 165.45 C 473.54 165.45 477.38 161.62 477.38 156.89 L 477.38 8.57 C 477.38 3.84 473.54 0 468.81 0 L 8.57 0 C 3.84 0 0 3.84 0 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 8.57 L 0.69 142.36 L 476.68 142.36 L 476.68 8.57 C 476.68 4.22 473.16 0.69 468.81 0.69 L 8.57 0.69 C 4.22 0.69 0.69 4.22 0.69 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 143.05 L 0.69 156.89 C 0.69 161.23 4.22 164.76 8.57 164.76 L 468.81 164.76 C 473.16 164.76 476.68 161.23 476.68 156.89 L 476.68 143.05 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 150.44)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="393.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS6.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:28.43em;">
<span id="A2.SS6.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS6.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt (ja)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 10.99)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.01em;--ltx-fo-height:8.93em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.18em;font-size:10pt;" height="125.92" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 123.5)" width="567.46"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS6.p4.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.01em;">
<span id="A2.SS6.p4.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS6.p4.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">患者ID {patient_id} は、{intervention_date} 頃にMRSA感染症のためバンコマイシンを投与されました。
バンコマイシン投与の推奨期間は、バンコマイシン開始後に採取された初回の陰性血液培養の日から数える必要があります。
このタスクでは、「陰性血液培養日」とは、その日に採取されたすべての血液培養が陰性である日と定義します。
同じ日に採取されたサンプルのいずれかが陽性であれば、その日は陰性とみなしません。
バンコマイシン開始以降、最初の血液培養陰性日から、その日を含めて、バンコマイシンが投与された総日数を計算してください。
{start_date} から {end_date} の期間に記録されたデータを使用してください。
結果は必ず次の形式のJSONオブジェクトのみ返してください：{”days_abx_since_first_neg_blood_culture”: 7}。</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Execution logs</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide execution logs illustrating interactions between the LLM and EHR-MCP. Each log consists of four components: the initial prompt, tool call request, tool call result, and final response. Both successful and unsuccessful cases are presented. For privacy, certain identifiers (e.g., patient IDs) are masked and shown as placeholders such as <span id="A3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;patient_id&gt;</span>. Because bacterial culture results are lengthy and complex, <span id="A3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">culture_history</span> and <span id="A3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">culture_neg_abx</span> are omitted.</p>
</div>
<section id="A3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.1 </span><span id="A3.SS1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">body_weight</span></h3>

<div id="A3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.SS1.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="288.56" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 288.56" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,288.56) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.57 L 0 280 C 0 284.73 3.84 288.56 8.57 288.56 L 468.81 288.56 C 473.54 288.56 477.38 284.73 477.38 280 L 477.38 8.57 C 477.38 3.84 473.54 0 468.81 0 L 8.57 0 C 3.84 0 0 3.84 0 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 8.57 L 0.69 265.47 L 476.68 265.47 L 476.68 8.57 C 476.68 4.22 473.16 0.69 468.81 0.69 L 8.57 0.69 C 4.22 0.69 0.69 4.22 0.69 8.57 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 273.56)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="393.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.SS1.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:28.43em;">
