</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.5 </span><span id="A3.SS5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">calculate_ccr</span></h3>

<div id="A3.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For this task, errors occurred only with Japanese prompts. Accordingly, we present the Japanese prompt with both successful and unsuccessful cases for the same patient. The LLM was required to retrieve body weight and serum creatinine. In the successful case, although the initial <span id="A3.SS5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">lab_results</span> tool call (#2) did not return serum creatinine because no blood test had been performed on that day, the LLM issued a subsequent request (#3) with an expanded date range and correctly retrieved the most recent serum creatinine value, as specified in the initial prompt. In contrast, in the unsuccessful case, the LLM terminated after the initial query (#2) and generated a hallucinated response instead. This error was categorized as an Argument Error.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS5.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.SS5.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="641.94" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 641.94" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,641.94) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.57 L 0 633.37 C 0 638.1 3.84 641.94 8.57 641.94 L 468.81 641.94 C 473.54 641.94 477.38 638.1 477.38 633.37 L 477.38 8.57 C 477.38 3.84 473.54 0 468.81 0 L 8.57 0 C 3.84 0 0 3.84 0 8.57 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 8.57 L 0.69 618.84 L 476.68 618.84 L 476.68 8.57 C 476.68 4.22 473.16 0.69 468.81 0.69 L 8.57 0.69 C 4.22 0.69 0.69 4.22 0.69 8.57 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.5 626.93)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="393.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
